<section class="sec alt" id="about"><div class="wrap"><h2 class="st">About us</h2><p>The Cement People is a building materials supplier in Kasoa. Our range includes cement from Supacem, Dzata and Ghacem, iron rods from 8 mm to 16 mm, available by the piece or by the ton, and binding wire.</p><p>Every product on this site is listed with its specification and price, giving you a clear starting point before you contact us. You can put together an estimate, send it on WhatsApp or save it as a PDF. We then confirm product availability and delivery costs for your site in Kasoa or elsewhere in Greater Accra.</p></div></section>
